est only the six already-supported core associations. Therefore I accept all six as internal robustness support and close these specific Ky-library sensitivity investigations. No validation is requested because the independent-validation budget is exhausted; the accepted core associations remain dataset-only associations requiring prespecified external replication before generalization.",
